{"id":"39fc3397fdfa6b91","group":"58","path":"58/batch13/58-thm-nonstationary-ideal.md","title":"Nonstationary Ideal","display":"thm-nonstationary-ideal — Nonstationary Ideal","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-nonstationary-ideal","aliases":["58-thm-nonstationary-ideal","Nonstationary Ideal","NS Ideal"],"display":"thm-nonstationary-ideal — Nonstationary Ideal","depends_on":["[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]","[[../batch17/58-df-omega1.md]]","[[../batch19/58-df-stationary.md]]","[[../batch18/58-thm-stationary-sets.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-nonstationary-ideal"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-nonstationary-ideal</span><span>Nonstationary Ideal</span><span>NS Ideal</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-nonstationary-ideal — Nonstationary Ideal"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md\">../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"27ae6ad867a7007d\" href=\"?note=27ae6ad867a7007d\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-omega1.md\">../batch17/58-df-omega1.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b802c3dd76418d95\" href=\"?note=b802c3dd76418d95\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-stationary.md\">../batch19/58-df-stationary.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"2937c88628bb358c\" href=\"?note=2937c88628bb358c\" title=\"../batch18/58-thm-stationary-sets.md\">../batch18/58-thm-stationary-sets.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega_1\">\\(\\omega_1\\)</span> (first uncountable cardinal, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"27ae6ad867a7007d\" href=\"?note=27ae6ad867a7007d\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-omega1.md\">../batch17/58-df-omega1.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"NS_{\\omega_1}\">\\(NS_{\\omega_1}\\)</span> (nonstationary ideal on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega_1\">\\(\\omega_1\\)</span>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Stationary}(A, \\omega_1)\">\\(\\mathrm{Stationary}(A, \\omega_1)\\)</span> (stationary subset of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega_1\">\\(\\omega_1\\)</span>, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"b802c3dd76418d95\" href=\"?note=b802c3dd76418d95\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-stationary.md\">../batch19/58-df-stationary.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\triangle_{\\xi&lt;\\omega_1}A_\\xi=\\{\\alpha&lt;\\omega_1\\mid\\exists\\xi&lt;\\alpha\\;(\\alpha\\in A_\\xi)\\}\">\\(\\triangle_{\\xi&lt;\\omega_1}A_\\xi=\\{\\alpha&lt;\\omega_1\\mid\\exists\\xi&lt;\\alpha\\;(\\alpha\\in A_\\xi)\\}\\)</span> (diagonal union)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}nonstationary\\text{-}ideal}\\vdash\n\\left[\nNS_{\\omega_1}\n=\n\\{A\\subseteq\\omega_1\\mid\\neg\\mathrm{Stationary}(A,\\omega_1)\\}\n\\right]\n\\land\n\\left[\n\\forall\\delta&lt;\\omega_1\\;\\forall\\langle A_\\xi\\mid\\xi&lt;\\delta\\rangle\n\\in(NS_{\\omega_1})^\\delta\\;\n\\bigcup_{\\xi&lt;\\delta}A_\\xi\\in NS_{\\omega_1}\n\\right]\n\\land\n\\left[\n\\forall\\langle A_\\xi\\mid\\xi&lt;\\omega_1\\rangle\n\\in(NS_{\\omega_1})^{\\omega_1}\\;\n\\triangle_{\\xi&lt;\\omega_1}A_\\xi\\in NS_{\\omega_1}\n\\right]\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}nonstationary\\text{-}ideal}\\vdash\n\\left[\nNS_{\\omega_1}\n=\n\\{A\\subseteq\\omega_1\\mid\\neg\\mathrm{Stationary}(A,\\omega_1)\\}\n\\right]\n\\land\n\\left[\n\\forall\\delta&lt;\\omega_1\\;\\forall\\langle A_\\xi\\mid\\xi&lt;\\delta\\rangle\n\\in(NS_{\\omega_1})^\\delta\\;\n\\bigcup_{\\xi&lt;\\delta}A_\\xi\\in NS_{\\omega_1}\n\\right]\n\\land\n\\left[\n\\forall\\langle A_\\xi\\mid\\xi&lt;\\omega_1\\rangle\n\\in(NS_{\\omega_1})^{\\omega_1}\\;\n\\triangle_{\\xi&lt;\\omega_1}A_\\xi\\in NS_{\\omega_1}\n\\right]\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The second conjunct is <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega_1\">\\(\\omega_1\\)</span>-completeness; the third is normality.</li>\n<li>Saturation is not part of ZFC. Strong forcing axioms can add saturation properties, but those require separate hypotheses.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-omega1.md","status":"resolved","id":"27ae6ad867a7007d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-omega1.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch19/58-df-stationary.md","status":"resolved","id":"b802c3dd76418d95","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch19/58-df-stationary.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-thm-stationary-sets.md","status":"resolved","id":"2937c88628bb358c","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-thm-stationary-sets.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-omega1.md","status":"resolved","id":"27ae6ad867a7007d","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading